    "PERSONAL_DRAFT": "MiniAppDraftService: ACTIVE actor + stable auth_session_id + confirmed READY ACTIVE warehouse + actor/operation/document/scan-session intersection; recheck before receipt replay. P04 additionally requires canonical KHO-TONG-HN. No canonical document exists merely because a draft was saved.",
    "WARRANTY_OWNER": "P09WarrantyScope and persisted WarrantyWarehouseScope; ACTIVE actor, stable session, READY permitted ACTIVE warehouse and trusted organization dimensions. PII and linked documents are independently redacted.",
    "COMPONENT_OWNER": "EnforceComponentIssueWarehouseScope plus concrete warranty case, component identity, stock and document owner; warranty.component_issue is distinct from warranty.manage.",
    "NFC_OWNER": "P07 current stable session and READY permitted ACTIVE warehouse; persisted NFC assignment warehouse or item ledger history, not creator or SKU. Reservation/confirmation readback is bound to the owner operation.",
    "DOCUMENTS_OWNER": "P12MixedDocumentScope: READY permitted ACTIVE warehouse and trusted dimensions; only permitted INBOUND/OUTBOUND/WARRANTY branches are queried. Detail navigation uses the concrete owner ACL, not aggregate membership.",
    "ATTACHMENT_OWNER": "DocumentAttachmentController resolves the concrete parent/document warehouse and operation ACL; broad route OR permission alone does not authorize another parent's attachment.",
    "CATALOG_OWNER": "P06 confirmed READY permitted ACTIVE warehouse and real SKU/item owner queries. Directory SKU is not physical placement; item scope uses warehouse ledger or permitted persisted warranty ownership.",
    "P18_LOCATION_OWNER": "P18ComponentLocationRead: actual scoped grants, stable session, READY exact warehouse, exactly one persisted ACTIVE warehouse row and no second row, trusted matching dimensions, physical identity and confirmed putaway proof; revalidate grants/context after snapshot.",
    "REPORT_OWNER": "Existing report/export owner validates report type, warehouse/data scope, job ownership and any independent PII export requirements. report.export alone never supplies another job's data."
  },
  "capabilities": {
    "DRAFT_OWNER": "Existing draft schema/session/context readiness, optimistic version and exact idempotency/receipt reconciliation; capability false is not a missing permission key.",
    "INBOUND_NUMBERING": "P04 existing numbering schema and canonical inbound configuration; no number allocated by viewing this mapping.",
    "P05_NUMBERING": "P05NumberedDraft::capability: MANUAL_CREATE_ONLY, numbering schema_ready and actual save grants; X-Outbound-Numbering-Contract=p05-save-numbering-v1. Source-linked mode cannot allocate a new PX.",
    "DEVICE_CAMERA": "Client camera/readiness is independent of server scan permission; no server mapping can prove device availability.",
    "DEVICE_NFC": "Device reader/writer readiness is independent of physical_code.assign_rfid; backend prepare/confirm/receipt and migration checks remain mandatory.",
    "P07_SCHEMA": "P07 persisted NFC warehouse/session schema is required; missing migration returns NFC_P07_MIGRATION_REQUIRED, not an authorization tick.",
    "P12_AGGREGATE": "Existing p12_mixed_documents.enabled and aggregate schema/source readiness; OFF returns DOCUMENTS_AGGREGATE_DISABLED. This handoff does not enable it.",
    "P18_REPRESENTATION": "X-Component-Location-Contract=p18-component-location-read-v1 AND X-Read-Fields-Contract=explicit-read-fields-v1; current_location additionally requires actual putaway.view OR putaway.manage. Missing placement permission omits the field with REDACTED_PERMISSION, not the identity.",
